---
/*
  PROTOTYPE · POV 4 "The Material Library" · THROWAWAY
  Wayfinder ticket #12. Not production. Delete or absorb when the prototype
  has answered its question: does a wall of real BRC specimens, curated and
  MOUNTED as physical samples with paper spec tags, read as "real steel on a
  supplier's sample wall" (crafted precision, object-as-evidence), or does it
  collapse into "a catalog grid of product cards" (the "books" failure mode)?

  Self-contained: does NOT import Blueprint Field global.css or Base.astro.
  Run: astro dev -> visit /prototype-material-library

  DIRECTION CONTRACT (this prototype only, not a new DESIGN.md)
  THESIS: Real steel, curated and mounted. BSM's sample wall — the supplier's
    reference library of real cut specimens, each tagged with honest specs.
    Refuses the catalog-grid-of-cards default and the "books" impression.
  OWN-WORLD: A LIVING perforated-steel sample wall. An OGL fragment shader
    renders the pegboard ground as reactive galvanized steel (raking light
    drifts + follows the cursor, holes catch sheen, spangle noise, scroll
    parallax). The FOREGROUND belongs to that wall: specimens are mounted
    steel plates with brushed-metal frames + corner brackets, hung paper
    spec tags on pins, stenciled industrial display type, engraved rail
    labels. A cursor-aware light syncs foreground highlights/shadows to the
    shader's light so mounted objects read as lit by the same source.
    Signal-orange reserved for the WhatsApp quote CTA only.
  STORY: A visitor enters a living material library, the wall breathes and
    responds to their cursor, specimens mount as they scroll, each reads as a
    physical steel object with an honest spec tag, and they ask for a quote.
  FIRST VIEWPORT: A straight-on sample wall: the shader ground is alive (light
    follows the cursor); panel/tiang/pintu mounted as steel plates with hung
    tags; placard headline "Baja asli. Dirakit. Ditagih spesifikasinya."; a
    stamped WhatsApp quote CTA. Foreground and ground share one light.
  FORM: Material Library (POV 4), one of four locked POVs (ticket #8); a
    prototype variant, not a concept-seed roll. Seed: wayfinder #12.
  FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the
    finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md.
*/
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import { imageAsset } from "../utils/images.ts";
import { categories, brcShowcase } from "../data/catalog.ts";
import { u, waLink } from "../utils/url.ts";

const wa = waLink();
const waBrc = waLink(
  "Halo BSM, saya butuh penawaran lengkap pagar BRC (panel, tiang, pintu, aksesoris). Mohon info harga pabrik, stok, pengiriman. Terima kasih."
);

const heroSpecimens = [
  brcShowcase.items.find((i) => i.slug === "pagar-brc-panel")!,
  brcShowcase.items.find((i) => i.slug === "pintu-pagar-brc")!,
  brcShowcase.items.find((i) => i.slug === "tiang-brc")!,
];
const proof = brcShowcase.proof.slice(0, 4);
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
